; Test: Conflicting teams without superiority
; Coverage: multiple supporting rules do not preempt opposing defeasible support

; Two rules for p, one rule for ~p, no superiority
(given a)
(given b)
(given c)
(normally r1 a p)
(normally r2 b p)
(normally r3 c (not p))

; Without superiority, ambiguity blocks both p and ~p (SDL).
; Superiority is per-rule: r3 blocks both r1 and r2 since
; neither r1 > r3 nor r2 > r3 holds.
; EXPECT: +d a
; EXPECT: +d b
; EXPECT: +d c
; EXPECT: -d p
; EXPECT: -d ~p
